# An unlit cap on the post's top with an added red emission.
mesh 0.2 0.05 0.05
vertices -0.3 4.4 3.05  0.3 4.4 3.05  0.3 4.7 3.05  -0.3 4.7 3.05
vertices 0.3 4.4 2.75  -0.3 4.4 2.75  -0.3 4.7 2.75  0.3 4.7 2.75
